{'symbol': 'RSG', 'date': '2021-10-06 09:04:00', 'title': "REPUBLIC SERVICES OPENS CALIFORNIA'S FIRST FULLY SOLAR-POWERED COMPOST FACILITY", 'text': "PHOENIX, OCT. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REPUBLIC SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: RSG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF CALIFORNIA'S FIRST FULLY SOLAR-POWERED COMPOST FACILITY, WHICH WILL RECYCLE FOOD AND YARD WASTE FROM THE SAN DIEGO REGION. REPUBLIC'S NEW OTAY COMPOST FACILITY IN CHULA VISTA, CALIF."}